OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother largely fine day,
OL,6,Fbut rather cloudy and breezy. Despite
OL,7,Fsome brighter or sunny intervals, this
OL,8,Fwill lead to a rather cold feel.
OL,9,FPerhaps some rain into the northwest
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLess
OL,13,Fcold on Sunday and Monday, but also
OL,14,Fturning changeable with spells of rain
OL,15,Falong with drier and brighter
OL,16,Fintervals. Staying unsettled on
OL,17,FTuesday, but potentially turning
OL,18,Fcolder again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
